  "amendment_note": "v0.5: promotes exactly one change from the pre-registered v0.5 candidate round (spec-v0.5-candidates.md) -- C7, indicator #1's yield-curve lookback_days from 365 to 730. The sweep (365/540/730) produced byte-identical Watch/Warning lead times and control-window outcomes at every value across 1988-2026; every date where results diverge falls after a recession's onset, never before, so the longest lookback carries zero backtest cost while closing the gap where #1's post-inversion memory expired in March 2026. Six other candidates (C4-C9) were tested and rejected or demoted to watchlist; see CHANGELOG.md. Indicator membership, persistence rules, tier fractions, threshold scale (x0.95, from v0.3), and all other params unchanged.",
